  "prefLabel": "Ph 601.04 Consultant Pharmacist",
  "priorExpiration": "2014-02-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 601.04 Consultant Pharmacist. All applicants licensed under the provisions of RSA 318:51-b shall have a written contract with a pharmacist, licensed in NH, to serve as a consultant on all matters relating to procurement, storage and dispensing of prescription drugs as defined in RSA 318:1, XVII.\n\nSource. #8572, eff 2-23-06, EXPIRED: 2-23-14\n\nNew. #12335, eff 7-22-17",
